  },
  data: {
    LLM: 'Three or four players (dealer sits out if four). Deal: 2 cards each, 2 to talon, then 2-2-2-2 each (10 cards per player). Bidding: eldest hand starts; players bid number of tricks (6–10) and trump (spades, clubs, diamonds, hearts, no trump) or misère. Highest bidder becomes declarer, takes talon, discards two cards, declares contract. Defenders choose to whist or pass; if both pass, declarer wins without play. Play: eldest hand leads; must follow suit, else must trump if possible. Trick winner leads next. Declarer must make contracted tricks; defenders who whist must make their quota.',
    Player: 'Three or four players (dealer sits out if four). Deal: 2 cards each, 2 to talon, then 2-2-2-2 each (10 cards per player). Bidding: eldest hand starts; players bid number of tricks (6–10) and trump (spades, clubs, diamonds, hearts, no trump) or misère. Highest bidder becomes declarer, takes talon, discards two cards, declares contract. Defenders choose to whist or pass; if both pass, declarer wins without play. Play: eldest hand leads; must follow suit, else must trump if possible. Trick winner leads next. Declarer must make contracted tricks; defenders who whist must make their quota.',
    objective: "Complete a predetermined amount of 'Bullet' points while keeping your 'Mountain' (penalty points) low.",
    gameplay: 'Three or four players (dealer sits out if four). Deal: 2 cards each, 2 to talon, then 2-2-2-2 each (10 cards per player). Bidding: eldest hand starts; players bid number of tricks (6–10) and trump (spades, clubs, diamonds, hearts, no trump) or misère. Highest bidder becomes declarer, takes talon, discards two cards, declares contract. Defenders choose to whist or pass; if both pass, declarer wins without play. Play: eldest hand leads; must follow suit, else must trump if possible. Trick winner leads next. Declarer must make contracted tricks; defenders who whist must make their quota.',
